    "innovation": "This article synthesizes scientific evidence explaining the 'global-warming hiatus', attributing the stalled atmospheric temperature rise to natural variability, specifically a cool phase of the Pacific Decadal Oscillation that has caused the deep ocean to absorb excess heat.",
