            "target_entity_instance": "South America",
            "target_entity_type": "Continent",
            "paragraph": "When they slackened, the warm water sloshed back towards South America, resulting in a spectacular example of a phenomenon known as El Ni\u00f1o. Average global temperatures hit a record high in 1998 \u2014 and then the warming stalled.",
