            "target_entity_instance": "equatorial Pacific",
            "target_entity_type": "No_Country_Region",
            "paragraph": "The latest suspect is the El Ni\u00f1o of 1997-98, which pumped prodigious quantities of heat out of the oceans and into the atmosphere - perhaps enough to tip the equatorial Pacific into a prolonged cold state that has suppressed global temperatures ever since.",
